Stability release. One screen failing no longer stops the whole app.

• Fixed a crash that could leave the app on an error screen with no way back
• A screen that does fail now names itself, and the rest of the app keeps working
• Past readings open reliably, including ones saved by earlier versions
• Voice input is hidden where the device does not support it
• Signing out returns you to the sign-in screen
• Swipe-back restored on Settings, Ask and Upgrade
